\fs26 \cf0 Installing\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa260\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Drag Textual onto the Applications folder, then open it from there. Textual can only update itself from Applications.\
You need macOS 14 or later, on Apple silicon or Intel.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Coming from Textual 7\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa260\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 The first launch offers to bring over your settings, servers, scrollback, styles and license. Nothing in Textual 7 is moved or changed by the import.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf0 Trying and buying\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa260\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0 \cf0 Each Mac gets one 30-day trial, with no account and no card. A license key works on 2 Macs at a time.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa40\partightenfactor0

